# Site resources

Maintainer notes live in `docs/resources.md`. Never copy them into `content/`, `static/`, a Hugo page, or a commit message that restates secrets. Hugo publishes `content/` and `static/` only.

- Cursor: `[params.cursor]` in `hugo.toml` and `static/images/cursor.png` (32×32). `x` and `y` are the hotspot. Delete `image` to use the normal pointer.
- Banner: `[params.home]` `bannerDir` (folder under `static/`, random pick on refresh), fallback `banner`, plus `bannerAlt`. Markup is `layouts/index.html`. Homepage title under the banner: `displayTitle`, `titleFont`, optional `titleFontUrl`. `static/css/retro.css` adds twinkling corner sparkles on the homepage banner only — not gallery, article, or writing-index thumbs (no border/wash; GeoCities vibe, not CRT). Fun custom cursor is owner-later — leave `[params.cursor]` alone unless asked.
- Sprites: `[[params.sprites]]` in `hugo.toml` + strips in `static/images/sprites/`. Shortcode `sprite`. `[params.home] logoSprite` makes that strip the home nav button (`layouts/partials/header.html`). Misdreavus is front-hover only; Kagura rows are `kagura-walk` / `kagura-down` / `kagura-attack` (wind is baked into the attack frames); Sango is `sango-idle` / `sango-walk` / `sango-hurt` / `sango-attack` / `sango-boomerang` (separate spinning Hiraikotsu projectile); SkiFree is `skifree-ski` / `skifree-yeti` / `skifree-crash`. Homepage dock: Sango left of the ticker (idle; flinch when Kagura’s wind sweep passes; click → throw boomerang at Kagura, she goes down, boomerang returns, both recover), Kagura parks right after the slash. Re-slice with `scripts/slice-*.mjs`.
- Player: `layouts/partials/player.html`, `static/js/player.js`, `static/css/player.css`. Homepage uses simple play/pause/stop/skip icons beside Visitors (opens there by default; subtle corner × → ♡). Desktop inner pages use the Winamp skin in the aside column (`--skin-width` + `--skin-gap`), document-absolute at the content-body/aside top so it scrolls with the page; Winamp’s own × swaps to a ♡ that `webamp.reopen()`s. Mobile (`max-width: 44.99rem`) non-home keeps the simple chrome (no skin). Skin windows are force-stacked by id before first paint; the host stays laid out (parked) in simple mode so SPA opens don’t collapse geometry. Music keeps playing only when the layout wraps the page in `#page-root` and includes the player partial after it.
- Playlist: `static/audio/playlist.json` is the local test list (`title`, `src`). The fetch URL is in `static/js/player.js`. A remote folder works only as HTTP URLs plus that JSON file and CORS. Do not call a Plex or Symphony library, a drive path, or put an API token in the site.
- Socials: `[[params.socialLinks]]` in `hugo.toml` (right nav). Per-page buttons: front matter `buttons`, the `button` shortcode, or `kind = "button"` in `[params.home.footer]`.
- Backdrop: `[params.backdrop.bottom-right]`, `bottom-left`, `top-right`, and `top-left`, each with a file under `static/images/`. Homepage only; fixed behind the page, outside `--middle-column` (53rem, homepage stack 40rem). All pages use a vertical charcoal→purple gradient with open (no pane) reading surfaces; corner art is homepage-only and stays fully visible. Max size is that corner's `maxwidth` and `maxheight`; a smaller file is not scaled up. `image = ""` leaves that corner empty.
